yle=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/11a6fa5ef8cdfed3aa30a43e22dded30.poster.avif?t=1787743888\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/11a6fa5ef8cdfed3aa30a43e22dded30.webm?t=1787743888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/11a6fa5ef8cdfed3aa30a43e22dded30.mp4?t=1787743888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you like the surreal feeling of regularly experiencing surreal events and highly specific easter eggs &amp; details that are so baffling you can't help but laugh, then this game is for you!</p>", "short_description": "Myths are 100% True is a Fast-Paced Combat-Platformer that feels like X-Files if it was made by 12 year olds in Movie Maker back in 2008.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/682c75f5719d437b752e944451bc1a9c457771a4/header.jpg?t=1787743888", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/92ccef95608c935171b7ddd9b0e0aba94cbe8082/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787743888", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/92ccef95608c935171b7ddd9b0e0aba94cbe8082/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787743888", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> In